.Dd August 22, 2026
.Dt FREEBSD-CAPSICUM 7
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm freebsd-capsicum
.Nd capability mode for agents, not MAC
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Capsicum is in GENERIC.
This skill wraps low-integrity agents with
.Nm pqcap-enter
.Pq first pass: stdio limit + Fn cap_enter + exec .
Casper is a later pass.
.Pp
Paper:
.Lk http://www.trustedbsd.org/2010usenix-security-capsicum-website.pdf
Watson, Anderson, Laurie, Kennaway, USENIX Security 2010.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr pqcap-enter 1 ,
.Xr cap_enter 2 ,
.Xr pqfreebsd 7
